OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is facing Kemi Badenoch at
OL,8,FPrime Minister's Questions - watch live
OL,9,Fabove
OL,11,FThe Conservative leader presses the
OL,12,Fprime minister on the Rosebank oil
OL,13,Ffield and his long-term spending plans
OL,15,FBurnham says a decision on the site in
OL,16,Fthe North Sea will be taken "in due
OL,17,Fcourse"
